{"title":"University of Toronto","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The University of Toronto is a university in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Toronto\" title=\"Toronto\">Toronto</a>, Canada. \nU of T has 3 campuses, 1 in downtown Toronto, another in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mississauga&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mississauga (page does not exist)\">Mississauga</a>, Ontario and in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Scarborough\" title=\"Scarborough\">Scarborough</a>, Ontario.\nSometimes, the name is shortened to U of Toronto or U of T.\n</p><p>See <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Toronto_Summer_Math_Academy\" title=\"University of Toronto Summer Math Academy\">University of Toronto Summer Math Academy</a>.\n<i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Toronto&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018045419\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 304/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.785      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.785      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:34946:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018045419 and revision id 273202. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}